---
import Definition from '../../layouts/Definition.astro';
import ItemShop from '../../components/screens/shops/ItemShop';
---

<Definition title="Item Shop" section="States">
  <ItemShop slot="preview" client:only="react" />

  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>Buy consumables and technique disks, or sell unwanted items, all in meseta (M).</p>

  <h2>Tabs</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Items</strong> — mates, telepipe, atomizers; support bulk-buy via a quantity selector</li>
    <li><strong>Materials</strong> — debug-only (dev builds), e.g. Photon Drop, Grinder Base C</li>
    <li><strong>Disks</strong> — Lv.1 technique disks, buy-1-only; use from inventory to learn</li>
    <li><strong>Sell</strong> — sell items for half their buy price</li>
  </ul>
  <p>A standalone Tech Shop also exists in-game for technique disks.</p>

  <h2>Location</h2>
  <p>Market area, accessed by interacting with the Item Shop NPC.</p>
</Definition>
